---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { tools } from "@/data/tools";
import { categories } from "@/data/categories";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Toolsiva"
  description="Learn how Toolsiva builds fast, focused and privacy-friendly online tools."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[84rem] px-4 py-12 sm:px-5 lg:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-300">About Toolsiva</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-5xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Useful tools should feel immediate.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-5xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-400 sm:text-lg">
        Toolsiva is a growing library of focused online utilities for text, development,
        security, QR codes, calculations and conversions. Our goal is to remove unnecessary
        accounts, clutter and waiting from everyday tasks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-5">
        <strong class="text-2xl text-white">{tools.length}+</strong>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">available tools</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-5">
        <strong class="text-2xl text-white">{categories.length}</strong>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">focused categories</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-5">
        <strong class="text-2xl text-white">Browser-first</strong>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">privacy-minded processing</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Fast by design</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          Tools open directly, update quickly and avoid unnecessary onboarding. The interface is
          designed around the task rather than promotional friction.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Private by default</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          Most input is processed in the browser. Each tool clearly communicates when its
          behavior differs from this default.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Focused and dependable</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          We prefer small tools with understandable results, responsive layouts and practical
          guidance over oversized applications.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:p-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">How Toolsiva is built</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          Toolsiva uses a static-first architecture and browser-side processing wherever
          practical. This keeps many tools responsive while reducing unnecessary transfer of
          user input. Every tool is designed around a recognizable task rather than a generic
          form forced onto unrelated workflows.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">How quality is reviewed</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          New tools are reviewed for calculation behavior, validation feedback, keyboard use,
          mobile layouts, copy and clear actions, privacy wording and understandable results.
          Important outputs should still be independently verified before high-stakes use.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-brand-400/20 bg-brand-500/[0.06] p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">A growing toolkit</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
        Toolsiva will continue adding tools carefully while improving quality, accessibility,
        mobile behavior, explanations and privacy transparency across the existing library.
        Suggestions and reproducible bug reports are welcome.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/tools" class="focus-ring inline-flex rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-500">
          Browse all tools
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="focus-ring inline-flex rounded-xl border border-white/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/5">
          Contact Toolsiva
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
